  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build Hospital for Pajian Village.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Life Givers is located in Pajian Village. There is no hospital in the village that provide medical facility to this village and all others villages that are located around this village. In emergency, villagers go far away hospitals and on the way chances of death raises. This hospital will reduce the chances of death and time and provide health facility to its rural people.</narrative>
  </description>
